    <string name="compass_help">Hold the phone flat, screen facing the sky, away from metal objects and magnets. If the reading seems wrong, draw several figure-eights in the air with the phone to calibrate it. North shown is magnetic north (a few degrees off map north in Europe).</string>
    <string name="cpr_step1">1. Have someone call 112 / 911 and fetch a defibrillator</string>
    <string name="cpr_step2">2. Hands in the centre of the chest, arms straight</string>
    <string name="cpr_step3">3. Push at each beep, 5 to 6 cm deep</string>
